> I've found many gems so far and just have two questions about them. If
> your inventory splits the same type of gems into two slots in your
> inventory does that always mean that one of those slots are real gems
> while the others are fake? 

There's one kind of worthless gems and two kinds of 
valuable gems for each color, IIRC.  Stacking applies 
to stackable stuff of the same kind and the same b/u/c 
status, same enchantment and same damage status.  Since 
most gems are uncursed (and neither enchanted nor rusty ;-)), 
odds are that different stacks represent different kinds of 
gems.  

